  decl_exported_err_const_own.pcpp - break step of decl_exported.pcpp:
  a constant decl_exported_unit's exported declarations are built from (CWide): still its own

  How to check, from repo\bin:
    pcpp res\tests\decl_exported_err_const_own.pcpp
